WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.599
Hello. This short video presents a new section prepared for the Çekicin app:

2
00:00:05.599 --> 00:00:08.551
the Partnership and Joint-Venture Programme.

3
00:00:08.551 --> 00:00:12.711
In the Çekicin AI project, six modules already work as a demo,

4
00:00:12.711 --> 00:00:15.932
with an average progress of fifty-eight percent:

5
00:00:15.932 --> 00:00:22.976
damage detection, repair cost, spare parts, voice guidance, nearby-place search and environmental impact.

6
00:00:22.976 --> 00:00:27.807
Most of the remaining work needs real data, field tests and integration.

7
00:00:27.807 --> 00:00:31.900
That is why we are looking for company and research partners.

8
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.346
There are five partnership models.

9
00:00:35.346 --> 00:00:42.611
One: an R and D, or research, partnership, with university labs and technopark firms running scientific tests.

10
00:00:42.611 --> 00:00:46.046
Two: co-development, in other words a joint venture.

11
00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:52.320
The development part of this project is run together with a company, and intellectual property,

12
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.490
revenue share and roles are set in the contract.

13
00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:59.718
Three: a technology and integration partnership, where insurers,

14
00:00:59.718 --> 00:01:04.341
vehicle assessors and parts platforms use the modules through the API.

15
00:01:04.341 --> 00:01:08.172
Four: a data partnership, with explicit-consent data only.

16
00:01:08.172 --> 00:01:11.210
Five: a distribution and regional partnership.

17
00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:16.631
For research partnerships, Türkiye has ready-made funding routes.

18
00:01:16.631 --> 00:01:20.647
In TÜBİTAK fifteen-oh-five, the university–industry programme,

19
00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:24.988
a university is the executing body and the company is the customer.

20
00:01:24.988 --> 00:01:29.069
Support for small and medium companies is seventy-five percent,

21
00:01:29.069 --> 00:01:34.446
and the twenty twenty-six TÜBİTAK contribution cap is two point three million lira.

22
00:01:34.446 --> 00:01:39.499
TÜBİTAK seventeen-eleven, the AI Ecosystem call, funds consortia of a company,

23
00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:42.414
a small technology firm and a university lab.

24
00:01:42.414 --> 00:01:46.237
This year’s call has closed, so our target is the next one.

25
00:01:46.237 --> 00:01:51.160
Technoparks such as Fırat Teknokent also offer infrastructure and mentoring.

26
00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:55.226
The newly added international route is Sweden.

27
00:01:55.226 --> 00:02:00.485
The partner type we are looking for is a small Swedish research and advisory company:

28
00:02:00.485 --> 00:02:07.105
firms that work on evidence synthesis, responsible AI, climate and health impact, and scientific reporting.

29
00:02:07.105 --> 00:02:11.683
Such a partner can validate the method of the environmental-impact module,

30
00:02:11.683 --> 00:02:16.818
review responsible AI and data protection, and co-write European project proposals.

31
00:02:16.818 --> 00:02:20.530
The best-fitting programme for a joint project is Eurostars.

32
00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:24.613
Vinnova funds the Swedish side and TÜBİTAK funds the Turkish side.

33
00:02:24.613 --> 00:02:30.985
Support for small companies is up to fifty percent in Sweden and up to seventy-five percent in Türkiye.

34
00:02:30.985 --> 00:02:35.131
Türkiye also takes part in Horizon Europe as an associated country.

35
00:02:35.131 --> 00:02:40.080
Our goal is to apply to the next Eurostars call together with a Swedish partner.

36
00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:44.414
For each module, we know which partner we need:

37
00:02:44.414 --> 00:02:50.243
labelled damage photos from insurers and assessors, real repair invoices from workshops,

38
00:02:50.243 --> 00:02:55.410
stock and price links from part sellers, verified addresses from tow networks,

39
00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:58.126
and a validation study with a university.

40
00:02:58.126 --> 00:03:07.069
The process has five steps: an intro call with an NDA, a joint plan, a four- to eight-week pilot, a contract, and a measurement report.

41
00:03:07.069 --> 00:03:11.176
The PDF, this video and all links are on the partnership page.

42
00:03:11.176 --> 00:03:14.290
This is a demo; there is no signed partner yet.
